# Wireframe: Notification Panel

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Notification Panel displays recent notifications with real-time delivery via WebSocket. Entry: user clicks notification badge. Exit: user clicks outside panel or presses Escape.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Notification panel is positioned fixed, not part of grid layout.

**App-shell**: Panel overlays content, positioned below notification badge.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Panel Container | Header, notification list, empty state | Fixed position, below badge, max-height with scroll |
| Header | "Notifications" title, "Mark All Read" action | Sticky top |
| Notification List | List of notification items | Scrollable |
| Empty State | "No notifications" message | Shown when no notifications |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ●  John commented on "Fix login"    2m ago                      |
|  ●  Sarah updated project "Frontend" 5m ago                     |
|     Mike completed cycle "Sprint 1"  1h ago                      |
|     (more items...)                                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Header Title | Text | Displays "Notifications" | None |
| Mark All Read | Button | Click marks all notifications as read | Disabled when no unread |
| Notification Item | NotificationItem | Click navigates to related entity | Shows unread indicator |
| Empty State | Text | Displays when no notifications | None |

## Data Display

Notifications are displayed in a list, sorted by most recent first. Each item shows:
- Unread indicator (blue dot)
- User avatar
- Notification message
- Timestamp

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Header Title | Identifies the panel | "Notifications" |
| Mark All Read | Offers bulk action | "Mark All Read", "Mark all as read" |
| Notification Message | Describes the event | "{User} commented on "{issue}"", "{User} updated project "{project}"" |
| Timestamp | Shows when event occurred | "2m ago", "1h ago", "Yesterday" |
| Empty State | Communicates no notifications | "No notifications", "You're all caught up!" |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Panel shows list of notifications with unread indicators.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ●  John commented on "Fix login"    2m ago                      |
|  ●  Sarah updated project "Frontend" 5m ago                     |
|     Mike completed cycle "Sprint 1"  1h ago                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty (No Notifications)

Panel shows empty state message.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon Illustration]                           |
|                     No notifications                              |
|                     You're all caught up!                         |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading (Fetching Notifications)

Panel shows skeleton loading state.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [==== skeleton bar ====]   [==== skeleton ====]                 |
|  [==== skeleton bar ====]   [==== skeleton ====]                 |
|  [==== skeleton bar ====]   [==== skeleton ====]                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error (Failed to Load)

Panel shows error message with retry option.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Error Icon]                                  |
|                     Failed to load notifications                 |
|                     [Retry]                                       |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success (Mark All Read Complete)

Panel briefly shows success indication, then updates to show all read.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Notifications                    [Mark All Read]                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|     John commented on "Fix login"    2m ago                      |
|     Sarah updated project "Frontend" 5m ago                     |
|     Mike completed cycle "Sprint 1"  1h ago                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (all unread indicators removed)
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full panel with all elements, max-width 400px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same as desktop |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width panel at bottom, larger touch targets |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Panel has role="region", aria-label="Notifications" |
| Heading order | No headings in panel |
| Reading / Focus order | Focus moves to panel when opened, tab through items |
| Accessible names | Mark All Read: aria-label="Mark all notifications as read", Notification items: aria-label="{notification message}" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab to items, Enter/Space navigates, Escape closes panel |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on all interactive targets |
| Focus not obscured | Panel doesn't obscure focused element (positioned below badge) |
| Non-color intent | Unread indicator + text, not just blue color |
